# {{ .Name }}

A [neusis](https://github.com/leoank/neusis)-managed fleet, scaffolded
with the `neusis` CLI.

## Layout

```
flake.nix            # flake entrypoint{{ if eq .Style "dendritic" }} (generated by write-flake){{ end }}
modules/
{{- if eq .Style "dendritic" }}
  dendritic.nix      # flake-file + import-tree wiring; declares inputs
{{- end }}
  systems.nix        # turns the machine registry into flake outputs
  registry/          # labs (groupings of machines and users)
  machines/          # one file per host
  users/             # one file per person
secrets/             # agenix-rekey secrets{{ if .Secrets }} (enabled){{ end }}
  common/            # shared rekeyFiles
  rekeyed/           # per-host rekeyed outputs
{{- if .Secrets }}
  master-identities.nix   # your agenix-rekey master identity
{{- end }}
```

## Common tasks

```bash
neusis add machine       # add a host (wizard)
neusis add user          # add a person (wizard)
neusis add registry      # add a lab
neusis add secrets       # set up / scaffold agenix-rekey secrets
```

## Building

```bash
# NixOS host
nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#<hostname>

# nix-darwin host
darwin-rebuild switch --flake .#<hostname>

# standalone home-manager
home-manager switch --flake .#<user>@<hostname>
```
{{ if eq .Style "dendritic" }}
After adding a new flake input (via `flake-file.inputs`), regenerate
`flake.nix`:

```bash
git add .              # nix ignores untracked files
nix run .#write-flake
```
{{ end }}
